{"id":"e1c2b8a9cf90dece","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Smooth Equivalence Relation","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Smooth Equivalence Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Smooth Equivalence Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation — ZFC Descriptive4 Smooth Equivalence Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma)\">\\((X,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (standard Borel space with Borel sigma-algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\">\\((\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (real line with its Borel sigma-algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(E\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (equivalence relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}\\)</span>（标准 Borel 空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4SmoothEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4SmoothEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4SmoothEquivalenceRelation}_S(X,\\Sigma,E,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land\\exists f:X\\to\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow f(x)=f(y))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4SmoothEquivalenceRelation}_S(X,\\Sigma,E,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land\\exists f:X\\to\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow f(x)=f(y))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>光滑性是向实数等号关系的 Borel 归约；定义域与陪域都必须携带标准 Borel 结构，而不只是任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,\\Sigma)$ (standard Borel space with Borel sigma-algebra, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}$（标准 Borel 空间谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S$ (equivalence-relation predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4SmoothEquivalenceRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4SmoothEquivalenceRelation}_S(X,\\Sigma,E,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land\\exists f:X\\to\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow f(x)=f(y))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1866,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1848","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive4-smooth-equivalence-relation]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9375de7089953a2b","3169dc41990b4bbe","908bc7b079f5d25b"]}